                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Nicely written story, with so many possible paths. The gameplay itself is not challenging, but I felt kind of pressured by the constantly running clock while I was trying to decide what to do next. And even with many unexpected events sometimes unwillingly changing my route, I had a lot of fun progressing across the globe. \nOne thing I did not expect was the fantasy steampunk aproach the story was set in (should've just read the short description), but still I think that was executed well.\nI can see myself putting many more hours into this, even after completing the journey within 80 days.",
